1. `out = c->serializer->embed(*this)` - embeds the GSUBGPOS header
2. `out->scriptList.serialize_subset(...)` - serializes script list as a sub-object
3. `out->featureList.serialize_subset(...)` - serializes feature list as a sub-object
4. `out->lookupList.serialize_subset(...)` - serializes lookup list as a sub-object
5. `out->featureVars.serialize_copy(...)` - copies feature variations

The `embed` copies the header bytes including the offset fields. Then `serialize_subset` and `serialize_copy` set the offset to 0 initially, push a new sub-object, serialize it, pop_pack it, and add a link.

