```cpp
bool serialize_copy (hb_serialize_context_t *c, const Type &src, const void *base, Ts &&...ds)
{
    *this = 0;
    ...
    c->push ();
    bool ret = c->copy (src, hb_forward<Ts> (ds)...);
    c->add_link (*this, c->pop_pack (), base);
    return ret;
}
```

And `hb_serialize_context_t::copy` for the priority 1 version calls `src.copy(this, ...)`. Let me look at what `FeatureVariations::copy` does.

