...
out->lookupList.serialize_subset (c, ...);

if (version.to_int () >= 0x00010001u)
    out->featureVars.serialize_copy (c->serializer, this+featureVars, out);
```

All the offsets in `out` that were copied from `this` get overwritten (set to 0 first, then linked). So they should be initialized.

